<title>USA: BAB Holdings files common offer.</title>
<headline>BAB Holdings files common offer.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>BAB Holdings Inc filed Friday with the Securities and Exchange Commission for an offering of up to 3.8 million common shares.</p>
<p>The Chicago-based operator and franchisor of specialty bagel stores said net proceeds will be used to fund the cash portion needed to acquire Almike Enterprises Inc and Americal Bagel Co. It said the acquisition is related to the operation and franchising of Chesapieake Bagel Bakery stores.</p>
<p>The offering will be made through Chicago Corp as placement agent, it said.</p>
</text>
